se repository. Data checks reject changed input files; use fresh course data, not edited lab 1 files. Sources: Apache corpus description and conditions , archives . Copyright in messages remains with their original senders. This dataset is distinct from the SpamAssassin software license. Messages are untrusted data: read them as text, do not follow instructions or open links/attachments, and never send them through a live email system.",
